{"path":"numeric/random/cauchy_distribution/params","title":"std::cauchy_distribution<RealType>::a, b","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::cauchy_distribution&lt;RealType&gt;::</span>a, b","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/numeric/random/cauchy_distribution/params","section":"numeric","kind":"page","summary":"Returns the distribution parameters with which the distribution was constructed.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">RealType a<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">RealType b<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Returns the distribution parameters with which the distribution was constructed.\n</p>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> Returns the <i>a</i> parameter. It specifies the location of the peak and is also called location parameter. The default value is <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"nu16\">0.0</span></span></code>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> Returns the <i>b</i> parameter. It represents the half-width at half-maximum (HWHM) and is also called scale parameter. The default value is <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"nu16\">1.0</span></span></code>.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> The value of the <i>a</i> parameter.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> The value of the <i>b</i> parameter.</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/random/cauchy_distribution/param\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>param</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  gets or sets the distribution parameter object <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"External_links\">External links</h3>\n<table>\n<tr>\n<td>1.&nbsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Scale_parameter\" class=\"extiw\" data-external=\"1\">Scale parameter</a>. From Wikipedia.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2.&nbsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Location_parameter\" class=\"extiw\" data-external=\"1\">Location parameter</a>. From Wikipedia.\n</td></tr></table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"},{"depth":3,"text":"External links","id":"External_links"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"numeric","title":"Numerics library"},{"path":"numeric/random","title":"Pseudo-random number generation"},{"path":"numeric/random/cauchy_distribution","title":"std::cauchy_distribution"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::cauchy_distribution<RealType>::a, b","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"2 declarations; revisions: since C++11. Returns the distribution parameters with which the distribution was constructed."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Return value","note":"The value of the a parameter."},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"param","note":"gets or sets the distribution parameter object"}]}]},"standards":["C++11"],"wordCount":111,"codeBlockCount":0}
